cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Cite this record only for the independent experiments under experiments/. Cite upstream mathematical
  manuscripts separately. See CITATION.md for individual report permalinks and scope.
type: software
title: Seven practical experiments associated with openai/math
authors:
- name: Lermont
  website: https://github.com/Lermont
abstract: Seven independent empirical studies and technical reports covering string storage, Elliptic2
  graph features, metric k-median and PAM, P2P broadcast topology, and matrix-exponential actions. Includes
  positive and negative results, reproducibility guides, and limitations. No independent peer review is
  documented in the repository.
